"Liam Long is a B-rank Brute who just graduated from Celena North University."
"He is pale, with sleek dark hair and a friendly face, and is faster than Alden."
"Hero programs in high school and university autorejected him for an imperfect GPA."
"In the Matadero flood he rejected his System teleport to train, and got no second slot."
"He and his siblings train in Boom Room 6 at Apogee Artist Spaces with stress and odd substances."
"He hopes a crisis will teach him to double-on his stats; Alden gave him injectors and bandages."
"He wants back his corn snake, Candy Corny, which Alden rescued and calls Tiny Snake."
